      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRINCESS DOCKER (7) broke through for her maiden success last time out at this track over 400m (22.90). Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. GIDDY UP GLADYS (4) looks close to another win after hitting the frame in a 8 length third (23.22) in a Grade 5 at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Racing well and deserves a win. HEY ZIPPER (2) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.53) at Gosford behind Tarawi Rex in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Got the money at her only try from this box. Can feature again. KILCOY PEARL (8) defied the market to win last start and can go on with it.",
